  "releaseNotes": "- PlaybackBar: Fixes auto-hide when idle in standalone hosts\n\t\t- PlaybackFeedback: Suppresses expected cancellation errors for interrupted opens/seeks\n\t\t- PlaybackFeedback: Uses cancellation-aware seek results and improves seeking state handling\n\t\t- Queue: Improves navigation responsiveness by interrupting superseded opens while preserving serialized requests\n\t\t- Queue: Updates titles immediately during navigation and preserves custom titles on failed opens\n\t\t- Queue: Highlights requested items immediately and automatically scrolls them into view\n\t\t- Settings: Adds support for application-defined reset defaults\n\t\t- Settings: Updates Player settings reset actions to use the configured reset source\n\t\t- Settings: Preserves FlyleafLib defaults when no custom reset configuration is provided\n\t\t- Settings: Clones mutable configuration values to prevent shared-state modifications",
